---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { standards } from '../data/safety';
import { SUPPORT_EMAIL } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout
  title="Trust & Safety — U;Good?"
  description="U;Good? is designed so the bad parts of the internet can't happen here: no strangers, no chat, no performance."
>
  <section class="wrap header">
    <div class="eyebrow">Trust &amp; safety</div>
    <h1>Built so the bad parts of the internet can't happen here.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Most apps keep people safe by moderating what goes wrong. U;Good? is designed so that most of it
      can't go wrong in the first place. Here's how.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="pillars">
    <div class="wrap pillars-inner">
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-title">No strangers</div>
        <p>Circles are invite-only. There is no public feed, no search, no suggested people, and no way for someone you didn't invite to see or contact you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-title">No chat</div>
        <p>There is no free-text messaging and no way to send photos or media. Responses come from a set of predefined caring replies, so no user-generated content can be exchanged.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-title">No performance</div>
        <p>No likes, no follower counts, no streaks. A check-in is a color and, optionally, a few words for people who already care about you.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap standards">
    <div class="standards-head">
      <h2>Our standards</h2>
      <p>These rules apply to everyone who uses U;Good?, in every circle.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="standards-list">
      {standards.map((s) => (
        <div class="standard-row">
          <span class="dot" style={`background:${s.dot}`}></span>
          <div class="standard-body">
            <div class="title">{s.title}</div>
            <p>{s.body}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="reporting">
    <div class="wrap reporting-inner">
      <div class="reporting-copy">
        <h2>Something doesn't feel right?</h2>
        <p>
          Tell us. Every report is read by a person and taken seriously. If a child is at immediate
          risk, contact your local emergency services first.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="reporting-card">
        <div class="eyebrow">Safety contact</div>
        <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`} class="contact-email">{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a>
        <p>Reports of child sexual abuse or exploitation are removed and referred to the appropriate authorities.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .header {
    padding: 56px 24px 72px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 58px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -1.2px;
    max-width: 760px;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .lede {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-secondary);
    max-width: 640px;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .pillars {
    background: var(--brand);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .pillars-inner {
    padding: 72px 24px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(240px, 100%), 1fr));
    gap: 36px;
  }
  .pillar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .pillar-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.6px;
  }
  .pillar p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--band-tint-deep);
  }

  .standards {
    padding: 88px 24px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(280px, 100%), 1fr));
    gap: 48px;
  }
  .standards-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .standards-head h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 40px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.6px;
  }
  .standards-head p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-secondary);
    max-width: 440px;
  }
  .standards-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .standard-row {
    padding: 24px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 18px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .standard-row .dot {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .standard-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .standard-body .title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 18px;
  }
  .standard-body p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-secondary);
  }

  .reporting {
    background: var(--surface-blue-tint);
  }
  .reporting-inner {
    padding: 72px 24px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(280px, 100%), 1fr));
    gap: 36px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .reporting-copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .reporting-copy h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.6px;
  }
  .reporting-copy p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-secondary);
    max-width: 480px;
  }
  .reporting-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 28px;
  }
  .reporting-card .eyebrow {
    color: var(--ink-tertiary);
  }
  .contact-email {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 26px);
    word-break: break-all;
  }
  .reporting-card p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-secondary);
  }
</style>
